# Project assets — large original media stays out of the repo.
# Curated copies are copied into public/media/ for the dev/preview server.
# The survey boundary GeoJSON (public/data/study-area-boundary.geojson)
# is also gitignored — it is dropped in locally once obtained; only the
# drop-in instructions (public/data/README.md) are committed.
/data/
public/media/
public/data/*
!public/data/README.md
